# SEO

- One search intent per URL. Variants go in sections/FAQ, not new pages.
- Titles and descriptions live in `Seo/SeoCatalog.cs`. Add every new route pair there and in `wwwroot/js/lang-boot.js`.
- Service area: ~90 minutes from Charlotte, NC or Rock Hill, SC. Raleigh is out of area.
- Do not promise claim approval, deductible waiver, 24/7, or same-day repair.
- New landings use `resource-site` chrome (`_SeoIntentHeader` / `_SeoIntentFooter`).
- After SEO HTML changes: `dotnet build` and verify the live URL plus `/sitemap.xml`.
